  HandbookIntro: "Bu el kitab\u0131, yap\u0131 ruhsat\u0131 ba\u015Fvurular\u0131nda aranacak en d\xFC\u015F\xFCk de\u011Ferleri i\xE7erir.\n\n1. Ba\u015Fvurudan binan\u0131n kat say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 oku.\n2. Tabloda o kat say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n s\xFCtununu bul.\n3. Laboratuvar raporundaki be\u015F de\u011Feri o s\xFCtunla kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r.\n\nTek bir de\u011Fer bile yetersizse yap\u0131 onaylanamaz."
